Package: desktop-htop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-psutil, python3-pyqt5
Recommends: lm-sensors, network-manager
Maintainer: Suryo Adhy Chandra <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: System Monitoring - widget monitor sistem di desktop
 Widget transparan di atas wallpaper yang menampilkan CPU per core, RAM,
 swap, jaringan (internet, WiFi, kecepatan up/down), NVMe, sensor suhu,
 PostgreSQL, MariaDB, MongoDB, Redis, serta container dan image Docker.
 Punya ikon di system tray, tema tulisan, dan bisa dijalankan otomatis
 saat login.
